handoff=f'''# Bounded Raw004 publication/native closure: staged source only

The package is frozen for a different agent's complete review. It does not grant execution or native authority. The author changed only this new namespace and retained912 independent original/copy pairs. The first nested-copy failure and all intermediate drafts remain preserved.

The35 sources contain31 native callers/dependencies, two publication templates and two test preparations. Thirty native caller files are byte-identical to Native003. The common, publisher and verifier now enforce schema3 with exactly two compiled historical middles and direct EA9→597→3f74→future-final edges, four fresh complete742-row tables, canonical grouped263 QA, three finite25 final diffs, and independently acquired middle release/commit/QA bytes. No directory scan or arbitrary ancestry rule is used. The seven I/O names,12 raw API arguments,44-field bus,35 input hash roles,17 metadata paths and eight sealed metadata keysets are retained.

Native policy capture preserves all31 typed facts in32489 bytes/578 nodes. Its source-owned container identities and finite domains precede iteration/callbacks and serialization. The cold/reuse guard retains named code, defaults, annotations, class/method/property, imported aliases and registry checks. Exact function name/qualname/module/doc text is checked before equality. Path nominal semantics remain unchanged. The new finite Git reader retains its direct process handle and caps buffers before extension; its ceiling is deliberately None until a reviewed derivation selects all command-role bounds. Its30-second cooperative wait and one-second retained-child reap do not prove descendant cleanup or a kernel/provider deadline.

The current unbound common is{audit['native_budget']['common_bytes']} bytes, growth{audit['native_budget']['growth_from178586']} from178586, leaving{audit['native_budget']['source_headroom']} source bytes. At the maximum encoded binding token it makes a{audit['native_budget']['canonical_frame_bytes_at_max_binding']}-byte canonical frame, leaving{audit['native_budget']['frame_headroom']} bytes. This margin is not approval of future literal growth: selected paths/caps may exceed it. All16 path selections, eight quoted OS commands, actual capture witnesses, final cap parity and physical whole-Job evidence remain None. The262142/262144/262145 frame,16384 encoded/12288 decoded bindings,8191 physical argv,383105 readiness,395799 raw ingress and361287 private schema3 limits are unchanged.

All111 Native003 and24 grammar005 test names are retained. The active files have128 native and29 metadata named methods;75 native families and421 declared subtest events are policy data, not observed results. New cases cover all31 replacements, nested callback traps, exact type/metaclass refusal, finite budgets, zero-sized rows, both historical middle reconstructions, three final edges, ordered role-pair hashes, unbound Git refusal, historical pre-read caps, and cold/reused foreign function metadata. Old M02's stale textual assertion is corrected; current Raw004 fixtures use85 functions/7 classes/one initializer generator. Historical Raw00381-function evidence remains preserved. Schema/lineage tests use actual pinned static historical bytes; current Git/final/runtime/OS/CIM/native-profile observations are explicit doubles. A separately reviewed fresh runtime/profile is required.

Author checks: AST and inert CodeType metadata for the new Python sources and authenticated Raw004,15 PowerShell parses with zero errors, shared frame decoder AST equality, GetCommandLineW-before-frame/internal-argv/source order,21 literal44 tables,12 Python and8 direct PowerShell capture sites,9 forwarders,74 shared publisher/verifier function/class ASTs, no direct required-keyword gaps, and paired provenance reobservations. Target definitions/imports/tests/Git/FFI/native/binding/production/public/scientific actions were not executed. Own metadata utilities were run; they only parsed, compiled inert metadata, derived bytes or composed this staged package. Their refused metadata attempts are preserved and must not be mistaken for test failures or successful target runs.

Read BOUNDED_CLOSURE_INTERFACE_001.json, SOURCE_SHAPE_BUDGET_TEST_AUDIT_005.json, CALLER_BOOTSTRAP_SHARED_SOURCE_AUDIT_003.json, FINITE_ACQUISITION_DERIVATION_CONTRACT_003.json, SOURCE_BEFORE_AFTER_DIFF_MANIFEST_001.json and CAUSAL_TEST_MATRIX_001.json. The historical Git batch-response bounds are11400277/11426854/11475344 bytes; fixed three pair-role caps are587/6030/62694. Final25 file caps, final commit/status/stderr limits and all17/35/7 operational metadata selections are unbound. Finite source semantics and actual behavioral closure require independent review and real bounded healthy/negative/restored controls; current D178, final release, source application and native GO are not admitted.

The author now stops. ROOT owns any future binding or first entry, after complete different-agent review, resource/clock/coordination checks and genuine actual evidence. Frozen predecessors, spent runs, twins, science, original reserves and all current live bytes remain untouched.
'''
once('HANDOFF.md',handoff)
